<Layout title="Privacy & accessibility | Mineola PS Council"><section class="wrap legal"><h1>Privacy & accessibility</h1><h2>Your visit</h2><p>This site uses no analytics, advertising scripts, payment processing or contact forms. Our hosting provider processes requests needed to deliver the website. External services, including Instagram and donation providers, have their own privacy policies.</p><h2>Accessible to our community</h2><p>We aim to provide readable content, keyboard navigation and accessible layouts. If you encounter a barrier, contact council through its linked Instagram account or the published council email when available.</p></section></Layout>